; The demos and the art they are built from: one small world per engine
; feature, plus the five-room showcase level that has all of them at once.
; Nothing in the engine depends on any of this, which is the point: it is
; content, and it lives outside the library it is content for.
;
; camlcast is the only dependency, SDL included: a demo that binds a key names
; a Camlcast.Key and never reaches past the engine for it, the same way a game
; does.

(library
 (name camlcast_demo)
 (public_name camlcast.demo)
 (libraries camlcast))
